    - id: "g_i3_archivist"
      nodes:
      - id: "n0"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Twenty-six. Ten years since the light. I have kept the count. Look at what Vessa became while you were becoming."
        nextId: "n1"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "n1"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "market"
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "market_v0"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "The Old Market is rebuilt. Stalls, lanterns, the smell of bread at dawn. They say your name there."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 19
          key: "market"
          value: "rebuilt"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "market_v1"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "The Old Market is ruined. Nobody trades there now. The Choir's graffiti has faded; nothing replaced it."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 19
          key: "market"
          value: "ruined"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "market_v2"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "The Old Market is contested still - Choir patrols by night, stallholders by day, and neither yields."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 19
          key: "market"
          value: "contested"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "market"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: "n2"
