    - id: "g_c3_cm_phase2"
      nodes:
      - id: "n0"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "p2"
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "p2_v0"
        speaker: "Dax, Final Enemy"
        text: "Ari. I sing now. Turns out I was always going to."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "dax_fate"
          value: "final_enemy"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p2_v1"
        speaker: "Mara, Turned"
        text: "You left me under the crane. I got up anyway. Look what got up with me."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "mara_fate"
          value: "turned"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p2_v2"
        speaker: "Mara"
        text: "Left side's mine. Don't you DARE die in front of me."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "mara_fate"
          value: "ally"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p2_v3"
        speaker: "Dax"
        text: "Right side. And Ari - we're telling everyone this one worked."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "dax_fate"
          value: "redeemed"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p2_v4"
        speaker: "The Choirmaster, Unmasked"
        text: "You came alone. Then hear it alone."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "p2"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "end"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 1
    - id: "g_c3_cm_phase3"
      nodes:
      - id: "n0"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "p3"
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "p3_v0"
        speaker: ""
        text: "Phase three: a race. The Choirmaster's song is gathering the Fracture; burn faster than it can sing."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "dominant"
          value: "ember"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p3_v1"
        speaker: ""
        text: "Phase three: a ward. The song is reaching for the people on the lower floors; keep it off them until it breaks."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "dominant"
          value: "tide"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p3_v2"
        speaker: ""
        text: "Phase three: attrition. The song cannot be outrun; it can be outlasted. Stand."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "dominant"
          value: "stone"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p3_v3"
        speaker: ""
        text: "Phase three: a window. When the song thins, everything already breaking will break. Wait for it. Take it."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "dominant"
          value: "hollow"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "p3_v4"
        speaker: ""
        text: "Phase three: everything at once. You were never one thing. Neither is this."
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "p3"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "end"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 1
    - id: "g_c3_final_decision"
      nodes:
      - id: "n0"
        speaker: ""
        text: "The Choirmaster's song is over. The heart of the Fracture is open in front of you - patient as the pier, warm as the last summer."
        nextId: "decide"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "decide"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "after"
        decisionId: "dec_ending"
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "after"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: "end"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "end"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 1
    - id: "g_ep_epilogue"
      nodes:
      - id: "n0"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Vessa, after. I kept the count to the end. This is how it reads."
        nextId: "n1"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "n1"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "ending"
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v0"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "ASHEN CROWN. The Choir is ash and so is the Spire's crown. Vessa is safe. Vessa locks its doors when you walk by. You do not mind. You tell yourself you do not mind."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "ashen_crown"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v1"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "TIDE'S EMBRACE. The light went into the sea and the sea forgave it. Relief lines became a harbour; a harbour became a city again. Mara's kite flies over the pier every summer. You hold the string."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "tides_embrace"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v2"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "THE UNMOVED. The Fracture is stone now and the districts you saved stand on it. The Wardens carve your name on the Long Wall. You did not move. Vessa learned it could stop moving too."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "the_unmoved"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v3"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "HOLLOW THRONE. The Spire collapsed and something sits where it stood. It wears your face and sings in Dax's voice. Vessa is very quiet. I am the only one who still says your name, and I am afraid of it."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "hollow_throne"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v4"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "BALANCE. The light stays, shared and watched. Mara watches the water; Dax watches the Reaches; you watch them both. Nothing ended. That was the hardest thing anyone in Vessa ever did."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "balance"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v5"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "MARTYR'S DAWN. You closed it from the inside. The first clean dawn in ten years came up over a city that did not yet know what it cost. They know now. They come to the pier."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "martyrs_dawn"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v6"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "THE LONG WAY HOME. You walked down. The song went on, then faltered, then stopped on its own - years later, with no one to hear it. You were at the pier. You were always going to be at the pier."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "ending"
          value: "long_way_home"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "ending_v7"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "The count does not read. That should not be possible."
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "ending"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: "n2"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "n2"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "epmara"
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "epmara_v0"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Mara: Lost. The kite string is still in your pocket."
        nextId: "n3"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "mara_fate"
          value: "lost"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "epmara_v1"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Mara: Turned, and unmade on the Spire. Vessa does not say her name near you."
        nextId: "n3"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "mara_fate"
          value: "turned"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "epmara_v2"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Mara: Ally. She fought beside you to the end, and she still comes to the pier."
        nextId: "n3"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "mara_fate"
          value: "ally"
          amount: 0
        end: 0
      - id: "epmara_v3"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Mara: alive, and a civilian. The relief lines run at dawn; she runs them."
        nextId: "n3"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "epmara"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: "n3"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "n3"
        speaker: ""
        text: ""
        nextId: ""
        branchPrefix: "epmentor"
        decisionId: ""
        conditions: []
        end: 0
      - id: "epmentor_v0"
        speaker: "The Archivist"
        text: "Kael: Fallen. The memorial is a coat, folded, on the Spire steps. Nobody has moved it."
        nextId: "n4"
        branchPrefix: ""
        decisionId: ""
        conditions:
        - type: 0
          key: "mentor_fate"
          value: "fallen"
          amount: 0
        - type: 6
